    <string name="how_to_play">How to play</string>
    <string name="how_to_play_body">1. Throw real Yut sticks, then enter the result in the app.\n\n2. Select one or more results in the order you want to use them.\n\n3. Select a piece. Available destinations will glow on the board.\n\n4. Tap the destination marker to move. Pieces on the same spot travel together, and landing on an opponent sends it back to waiting.\n\n5. Yut, Mo, or capturing an opponent grants another throw. Back Do moves a piece back one step and cannot bring a waiting piece onto the board.\n\n6. Use End turn when play is finished. In timed games, reaching zero ends the turn automatically.</string>
